== the second-stage objects on the cover g^2 = G ==
S_A <=> 2*(alpha_A + g*h_A) in {1, d_A} mod squares   (n_A = g*h_A)
S_B <=> 2*(alpha_B + n_B)   in {1, d_B} mod squares
with the exact identities 2(a+n)*2(a-n) = 4*d*beta^2 == d mod sq.
